# The Margo Cloud image (cloud/Dockerfile) is built from the repository root. Never send private state, local
# configuration or build outputs to the registry build.
.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/state/
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.azure/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user
tools/
tests/
evals/
docs/
packaging/
.github/
cloud/tests/
cloud/contracts/
cloud/scripts/
cloud/assets/
.autopilot-*
.work-state-test-*
**/*.local.md
**/tmp/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/forbidden.local.txt
# Ignored by git (so the build script's clean-checkout check does not see them) but never to be uploaded: the Agent
# 365 CLI's files (tenant identifiers, possibly a client secret), local agent settings and worktrees, publish outputs.
**/a365.config.json
**/a365.generated.config.json
.claude/
cloud/out/
cloud/artifacts/
.memory-store-test-*
